,255,255,0.7);\">Work through the training at your own pace.</span><a href=\"#\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:white;text-decoration:underline;\">Open training</a></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 36px;height:36px;border-radius:999px;background:white;color:#000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;\">3</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Download the Thoughtful app</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">Try a few sessions with T.</span><a href=\"#\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:white;text-decoration:underline;\">Download the app</a></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:18px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 36px;height:36px;border-radius:999px;background:white;color:#000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;\">4</span><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:white;\">Join the provider Slack group</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">Say hi and meet the other providers.</span><a href=\"#\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:white;text-decoration:underline;\">Join Slack</a></div></div><a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:36px;background:white;color:#000;border-radius:999px;padding:16px 28px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">Sign in to the Provider Portal</a><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin:32px 0 0;\">Need help? Email providers@springhealth.com</p></div></div>"
